{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">警方國安處回應支聯會案裁決。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">警務處國家安全處總警司李桂華稱，對裁決表示歡迎，並稱被告以人權做擋箭牌、勾結外部勢力。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-21T05:00:01.423057+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":58,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}